--   From HTo G Averaged Sandwich By Type Sub Meas Zero Total Eq One
-- statement:
--   **The zero-length averaged sandwich has identity total.** Let $F$ be a slice-indexed polynomial family and let $\tau$ be a Boolean type pattern of length zero. Write $H^{(0)}_\tau$ for the total operator of `averagedSandwichByTypeSubMeas` at the empty suffix. Then
--
--   $$
--   H^{(0)}_\tau=I.
--   $$
--
--   The empty-suffix total removes all tail averaging and initializes the type-pattern recurrence used in the from-H-to-G comparison.
